# error-key-junk-after-quote

## Input

```
"quoted"ppp value

```

## CST

```
SOURCE_FILE@0..18
  ENTRY@0..18
    QUOTED_KEY@0..11
      DOUBLE_QUOTE@0..1 "\""
      STRING@1..7 "quoted"
      DOUBLE_QUOTE@7..8 "\""
      ERROR@8..11
        STRING@8..11 "ppp"
    SPACE@11..12 " "
    LINE_STRING@12..17
      STRING@12..17 "value"
    NEWLINE@17..18 "\n"
```

## Syntax Error

```
[
    SyntaxError {
        message: "unexpected token after quoted key",
        range: 8..11,
    },
]
```

## AST

```
SourceFile {
    items: [
        Entry {
            key: QuotedKey {
                open_quote: DOUBLE_QUOTE@0..1 "\"",
                string: STRING@1..7 "quoted",
                close_quote: DOUBLE_QUOTE@0..1 "\"",
            },
            value: LineString {
                string: STRING@12..17 "value",
            },
        },
    ],
}
```

